  "sourceTitle": "Chocolate Chip Cookies Muffins",
  "sourceText": "Chocolate Chip Cookies Muffins\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 12:53am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 can sweetened condensed milk\n2 cups graham cracker crumbs\n1 cup pecans\n1 cup mini chocolate chips\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together and place in muffin cups and bake in mini muffin pan for 10 minutes. If cooked too long, they will stick to the paper cups.",
